never lie to you.

683
00:46:55.791 --> 00:46:57.750
I mean, I will, sometimes…
just harmless lies.

684
00:46:58.416 --> 00:47:00.625
But it'll never be a deceitful lie.

685
00:47:01.916 --> 00:47:02.750
Promise?

686
00:47:03.416 --> 00:47:04.750
